{"id":"a0860c302a6a6c7c","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-cor-zfc-models.md","title":"Inaccessible Rank Models of ZFC","display":"cor-zfc-models — Inaccessible Rank Models of ZFC","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-zfc-models","aliases":["58-cor-zfc-models"],"display":"cor-zfc-models — Inaccessible Rank Models of ZFC","depends_on":["[[58-df-inaccessible]]","[[58-df-v-alpha]]","[[58-thm-inaccessible-properties]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-assignment]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-zfc-models"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-zfc-models</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-zfc-models — Inaccessible Rank Models of ZFC"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"58-df-inaccessible\">58-df-inaccessible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"58-df-v-alpha\">58-df-v-alpha</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"056234534cd860b9\" href=\"?note=056234534cd860b9\" title=\"58-thm-inaccessible-properties\">58-thm-inaccessible-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (strong-inaccessibility predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"58-df-inaccessible\">58-df-inaccessible</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa\">\\(V_\\kappa\\)</span> (cumulative-hierarchy stage, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"58-df-v-alpha\">58-df-v-alpha</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\kappa\\)</span> (canonical membership structure with universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa\">\\(V_\\kappa\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"056234534cd860b9\" href=\"?note=056234534cd860b9\" title=\"58-thm-inaccessible-properties\">58-thm-inaccessible-properties</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> (set-coded ZFC axioms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span> (object-level semantic data, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}models} \\vdash \\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal V_\\kappa,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal V_\\kappa)=V_\\kappa\\land I^{\\mathcal V_\\kappa}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in V_\\kappa^2:x\\in y\\}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal V_\\kappa,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}models} \\vdash \\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal V_\\kappa,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal V_\\kappa)=V_\\kappa\\land I^{\\mathcal V_\\kappa}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in V_\\kappa^2:x\\in y\\}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal V_\\kappa,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa\">\\(V_\\kappa\\)</span> is a transitive model of ZFC for strongly inaccessible <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Externally, such a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> yields a transitive set model of ZFC and hence implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa\">\\(V_\\kappa\\)</span> need not itself contain an inaccessible cardinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-inaccessible","status":"resolved","id":"06ee5d7ff126e916","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-inaccessible]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-v-alpha","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-v-alpha]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-inaccessible-properties","status":"resolved","id":"056234534cd860b9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-inaccessible-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","locat